title: Kemi feels homesick
caption: First month abroad and missing home so much it hurts 🥹 You're not alone. Kemi's video call with Quddus will make you feel seen ❤️ Share it with someone far from home. #studyabroad #homesick #studentlife #storytime
hook: I MISS HOME SO MUCH | KEMI & QUDDUS
cta: YOU'RE NOT ALONE | 1f4f1 Call home, but go out too | 1f30d Find your community
ctasay: Share this with someone far from home, and comment where you're studying.
